  "sourceTitle": "Lemonade",
  "sourceText": "Lemonade\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n6 lemons, juiced\n2 cups water\n1/2 cup brown sugar\n1/2 cup white sugar\n2 cups ice cubes\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Extract the juice from the lemons. 2 In large pitcher, mix water, sugar and lemon juice, until sugar dissolves. 3 Stir in ice cubes.\n\nAbout\n\n\nUsing brown sugar in addition to white sugar improves the flavor of this summer classic.",
